{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07910","headline":"下灨石 · 孟浩然","name":"下灨石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灨石三百里，沿洄千嶂间。\n沸声常活活，洊势亦潺潺。\n跳沫鱼龙沸，垂藤猿狖攀。\n榜人苦奔峭，而我忘险难。\n放溜情弥惬，登舻目自闲。\n暝帆何处宿，遥指落星湾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}